1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,522
Month-end PayPal reconciliation means checking invoice references, partial payments, and fees.

2
00:00:05,522 --> 00:00:08,929
SettleSight puts the review queue beside the money totals.

3
00:00:08,929 --> 00:00:15,156
This recording uses synthetic demo data, with live NVIDIA Nemotron inference through Nebius Token Factory.

4
00:00:15,156 --> 00:00:22,962
The deterministic engine works in integer cents and separates suggested matches from approved allocations.

5
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:25,098
This run has 23 review items.

6
00:00:25,098 --> 00:00:29,369
Recorded and reconciled value starts at 17,285.00 dollars.

7
00:00:29,369 --> 00:00:32,167
No language model controls the ledger.

8
00:00:32,167 --> 00:00:33,713
I click Run AI Triage.

9
00:00:33,713 --> 00:00:37,788
The response comes from nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b.

10
00:00:37,788 --> 00:00:41,161
Nemotron ranks the queue and explains the risks.

11
00:00:41,161 --> 00:00:47,484
The displayed results are from a real API call; the waiting time is edited for this video.

12
00:00:47,484 --> 00:00:54,978
Of 23 evaluated items, 15 allocation proposals pass the engine, 5 are rejected, and 3 are ambiguity cases.

13
00:00:54,978 --> 00:00:58,796
Here the red card gives the exact invariant rejection.

14
00:00:58,796 --> 00:01:02,261
A confident explanation cannot bypass that check.

15
00:01:02,261 --> 00:01:05,367
I approve one validated candidate.

16
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:12,128
Recorded and reconciled value changes from 17,285.00 to 17,785.00 dollars.

17
00:01:12,128 --> 00:01:16,605
This approval updates the synthetic local ledger.

18
00:01:16,605 --> 00:01:19,712
It does not send a PayPal payment.

19
00:01:19,712 --> 00:01:23,353
Now I ask, Audit partial payments and fee discrepancies.

20
00:01:23,353 --> 00:01:25,499
Nemotron selects list exceptions.

21
00:01:25,499 --> 00:01:31,287
The visible tool trace comes from live model calls and executes against the engine state.

22
00:01:31,287 --> 00:01:33,824
The agent then summarizes the evidence.

23
00:01:33,824 --> 00:01:39,038
A separate cut shows Live Sandbox mode, with 30 real PayPal sandbox invoices.

24
00:01:39,038 --> 00:01:40,866
This is a test environment.

25
00:01:40,866 --> 00:01:46,419
A fresh API read confirms SS DEMO 028 is partially paid, with 25 dollars recorded.

26
00:01:46,419 --> 00:01:52,514
That payment was written in the earlier live verification; this recording only rereads it.

27
00:01:52,514 --> 00:02:02,281
SettleSight keeps three responsibilities clear: deterministic financial authority, Nemotron ranking and explanations on Nebius Token Factory, and human approval.

28
00:02:02,281 --> 00:02:07,801
The public repository includes setup instructions, tests, and the live verification report.
